il":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":81.75,"default_fair_val":81.75,"premium_pct":141.3,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":40.2,"pe_forward":35.4,"pb_trailing":9.8,"pb_forward":8.8,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":8.7,"fcf_to_ev":2.86,"fcf_to_mcap":2.87,"liab_to_assets":49.2,"cash_to_assets":13.9,"current_ratio":2.08,"roe":24.5,"roa":12.4,"moat":{"ticker":"SN","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 在廚房小家電領域建立了強大的品牌認知度，尤其以其創新和性能著稱。雖然其產品線廣泛，但並非所有產品都享有極高的定價權。品牌忠誠度是其優勢，但面對市場上眾多競爭者，尤其是在價格敏感的細分市場，其定價能力受到一定限制。公司透過持續的產品創新來鞏固品牌價值，但要達到頂級品牌的定價能力仍有成長空間。","comment_en":"SharkNinja has built strong brand recognition in the kitchen appliance sector, known for innovation and performance. While its product range is broad, not all products command premium pricing power. Brand loyalty is a strength, but intense competition, especially in price-sensitive segments, limits its pricing ability. Continuous product innovation reinforces brand value, but achieving top-tier pricing power still has room for growth."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 在產品設計和技術方面擁有一定的專利組合，這為其提供了短期競爭優勢，並阻止了模仿者。然而，家電行業的專利壁壘相對較低，技術迭代迅速，專利保護的時效性有限。公司依賴持續的研發投入來維持技術領先，而非依賴長期的、難以逾越的監管或專利壟斷。這構成了一定的護城河，但並非絕對。","comment_en":"SharkNinja holds a patent portfolio for product designs and technologies, offering short-term competitive advantages and deterring immediate imitation. However, patent barriers in the appliance industry are relatively low, with rapid technological evolution limiting patent effectiveness over time. The company relies on continuous R&D to maintain its technological edge rather than long-term, insurmountable regulatory or patent monopolies. This provides a moat, but not an absolute one."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"對於大多數 SharkNinja 的產品，消費者轉換成本相對較低。一旦購買了品牌的特定產品，例如吸塵器或烹飪設備，消費者可能會因為熟悉操作和配件兼容性而傾向於繼續購買同品牌產品。然而，這種忠誠度並非牢不可破，市場上存在大量替代品，且價格是影響消費者決策的重要因素。因此，轉換成本的壁壘強度中等。","comment_en":"For most of SharkNinja's products, consumer switching costs are relatively low. Once a consumer owns a specific product, like a vacuum or cooking appliance, they might lean towards the same brand due to familiarity and accessory compatibility. However, this loyalty isn't unbreakable, with numerous alternatives available and price being a significant factor in purchasing decisions. Therefore, the switching cost moat is moderate."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 的業務模式基本上不涉及網絡效應。其產品的價值主要體現在單一用戶的體驗和性能上，而非用戶之間的互動或連接。公司無法從用戶數量的增加中獲得指數級的價值提升，這意味著網絡效應幾乎不構成其護城河。","comment_en":"SharkNinja's business model fundamentally does not involve network effects. The value of its products is primarily derived from individual user experience and performance, rather than user-to-user interaction or connection. The company does not benefit from exponential value increases as its user base grows, meaning network effects are virtually non-existent as a moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"作為一家規模龐大的家電製造商，SharkNinja 受惠於規模經濟帶來的成本優勢。其龐大的生產量、採購能力以及供應鏈管理，使其能夠以較低的單位成本生產產品。這使其在價格競爭中具有一定優勢，並能維持健康的利潤率。然而，家電行業的供應鏈相對成熟，其他大型競爭者也能實現顯著的規模效益。","comment_en":"As a large-scale appliance manufacturer, SharkNinja benefits from cost advantages derived from economies of scale. Its substantial production volumes, purchasing power, and supply chain management enable lower per-unit production costs. This provides a competitive edge in pricing and helps maintain healthy profit margins. However, the appliance industry's supply chains are mature, and other large competitors can also achieve significant scale efficiencies."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 的業務遍及全球，但其核心競爭力並非來自於獨特的地理位置或資產。公司依賴於其品牌、產品創新和分銷網絡，而非特定地區的資源或市場壟斷。雖然其全球佈局有助於分散風險和擴大市場，但並未形成難以複製的地理壁壘。","comment_en":"SharkNinja operates globally, but its core competitive strengths do not stem from unique geographic locations or assets. The company relies on its brand, product innovation, and distribution networks, rather than specific regional resource control or market monopolies. While its global presence aids in risk diversification and market expansion, it does not create an insurmountable geographic barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 在營運效率方面表現出色，這體現在其高於行業平均水平的 ROE 和 ROA。公司能夠有效地管理其生產、庫存和分銷，快速響應市場需求，並將創新產品推向市場。其 F-Score 高達 9/9，顯示其財務健康狀況和營運效率極佳。這種卓越的營運能力是其重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"SharkNinja demonstrates strong operational efficiency, reflected in its above-average ROE and ROA. The company effectively manages production, inventory, and distribution, responding swiftly to market demands and bringing innovative products to market. Its high F-Score of 9/9 indicates excellent financial health and operational efficiency. This superior operational capability is a significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"從提供的數據來看，SharkNinja 的管理層在資本配置方面表現出較高的水準。高 ROE 和 ROA 表明公司能有效地將資本投入到能產生高回報的項目中。其健康的自由現金流（FCF TTM: $801.9M）和相對較低的淨負債（現金 $779.8M / 負債 $913.0M）顯示其有能力進行戰略性投資、股票回購或償還債務。這表明管理層能夠明智地運用股東資本。","comment_en":"Based on the provided data, SharkNinja's management exhibits a high level of capital allocation skill. Strong ROE and ROA indicate effective deployment of capital into high-return projects. Healthy Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM: $801.9M) and a manageable net debt position (Cash $779.8M / Debt $913.0M) suggest capacity for strategic investments, share buybacks, or debt repayment. This points to prudent use of shareholder capital."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 的客戶保留率得益於其產品的可靠性和持續的創新。一旦消費者習慣了 SharkNinja 產品的使用體驗和性能，他們傾向於再次購買。公司透過提供優質的客戶服務和保修來進一步鞏固客戶關係。然而，家電市場的競爭激烈，消費者選擇多樣，因此客戶保留並非絕對，仍需不斷努力維持。","comment_en":"SharkNinja's customer retention is bolstered by product reliability and continuous innovation. Once consumers become accustomed to the user experience and performance of SharkNinja products, they tend to repurchase. The company further solidifies customer relationships through quality customer service and warranties. However, the competitive appliance market offers diverse choices, meaning retention is not absolute and requires ongoing effort."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"SharkNinja 的產品，特別是其核心的廚房小家電和清潔設備，通常具有較長的使用壽命和耐用性，這有助於建立品牌聲譽。公司透過不斷的技術升級和質量控制來確保產品的持久性。雖然家電產品會隨著技術進步而過時，但其核心功能和耐用性使其在一定程度上能夠抵禦時間的考驗，提供相對穩定的價值。","comment_en":"SharkNinja's products, particularly its core kitchen appliances and cleaning devices, generally offer a good lifespan and durability, contributing to brand reputation. The company ensures longevity through continuous technological upgrades and quality control. While appliances can become technologically outdated, their core functionality and durability allow them to withstand the test of time to a degree, providing relatively stable value."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"SharkNinja 在家電領域展現了穩固的競爭優勢，主要體現在其卓越的營運效率（M7）和良好的資本配置能力（M8）上。其品牌價值（M1）和規模經濟（M5）也提供了重要的護城河，使其能夠在市場上保持領先地位。然而，其護城河並非無懈可擊，尤其是在網絡效應（M4）和轉換成本（M3）方面較為薄弱。專利（M2）和耐用性（M10）提供了一定保護，但易受技術快速迭代影響。總體而言，SharkNinja 擁有一個類似於『高效製造商』的護城河，能夠持續提供高性價比的產品，並在市場中獲取可觀利潤，但缺乏類似『收費橋』或『特許經營』的絕對壟斷地位。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"SharkNinja possesses solid competitive advantages in the appliance sector, primarily driven by its strong operational efficiency (M7) and adept capital allocation (M8). Its brand equity (M1) and economies of scale (M5) also provide significant moats, enabling market leadership. However, its defenses are not impenetrable, showing particular weakness in network effects (M4) and switching costs (M3). Patents (M2) and durability (M10) offer some protection but are susceptible to rapid technological change. Overall, SharkNinja exhibits a moat akin to an 'efficient manufacturer,' consistently delivering value and profitability, but lacks the absolute dominance of a 'toll bridge' or 'franchise' business.","evidenceHash":"4f9a164d21a708cc1c6b230b6f439544cfe91e350fd127bf88391ccac4c7ad32","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":9,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"superRobust","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"aeb3412440e44a641fd7b38bc956aa09bf52ee19913825d1263b93f7d263618e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-27T16:12:46.364Z","evidenceHash":"aeb3412440e44a641fd7b38bc956aa09bf52ee19913825d1263b93f7d263618e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SN.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/SN.png","website":"https://www.sharkninja.com","ceo":"Mark Barrocas","full_time_employees":"4143","description":"SharkNinja, Inc., a product design and technology company, engages in the provision of various solutions for consumers in the United States, China, and internationally. It offers cleaning appliances, including corded and cordless vacuums, such as handheld and robotic vacuums, as well as other floorcare products comprising steam mops, wet/dry cleaning floor products, and carpet extraction; fans, coolers, frozen drink appliances, propane grills, and fire pits; and cooking and beverage appliances, such as air fryers, multi-cookers, outdoor and countertop grills and ovens, coffee systems, carbonation, cookware, cutlery, kettles, and toasters and bakeware products. The company also provides food preparation appliances, which include blenders, food processors, ice cream makers, juicers, and frozen drink appliances and coolers; haircare and skincare beauty appliances, as well as home environment products comprising air purifiers and fans. It sells its products through traditional brick-and-mortar retail channels and e-commerce channels, distributors, and direct-to-consumer channels under Shark and Ninja brands. SharkNinja, Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts.","description_en":"SharkNinja, Inc., a product design and technology company, engages in the provision of various solutions for consumers in the United States, China, and internationally. It offers cleaning appliances, including corded and cordless vacuums, such as handheld and robotic vacuums, as well as other floorcare products comprising steam mops, wet/dry cleaning floor products, and carpet extraction; fans, coolers, frozen drink appliances, propane grills, and fire pits; and cooking and beverage appliances, such as air fryers, multi-cookers, outdoor and countertop grills and ovens, coffee systems, carbonation, cookware, cutlery, kettles, and toasters and bakeware products. The company also provides food preparation appliances, which include blenders, food processors, ice cream makers, juicers, and frozen drink appliances and coolers; haircare and skincare beauty appliances, as well as home environment products comprising air purifiers and fans. It sells its products through traditional brick-and-mortar retail channels and e-commerce channels, distributors, and direct-to-consumer channels under Shark and Ninja brands. SharkNinja, Inc. was incorporated in 2017 and is headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts.","description_zh":"**SharkNinja, Inc. (SN) 業務營運分析**\n\nSharkNinja, Inc. 是一家專注於產品設計與技術創新的消費性產品公司，業務遍及美國、中國及全球市場。公司核心業務聚焦於提供多元化的家電解決方案，主要劃分為以下幾大板塊：\n\n1.  **清潔家電 (Cleaning Appliances)：** 涵蓋有線及無線吸塵器，包括手持式、掃地機器人，以及其他地板護理產品，如蒸氣拖把、乾濕兩用清潔機、地毯清潔機等。\n2.  **居家環境與戶外休閒 (Home Environment & Outdoor Leisure)：** 提供風扇、涼風扇、製冰飲機、瓦斯烤爐及火爐等產品。\n3.  **烹飪與飲品家電 (Cooking & Beverage Appliances)：** 產品線包括氣炸鍋、多功能料理鍋、戶外及檯面式烤箱、咖啡機、氣泡水機、鍋具、刀具、電熱水壺、烤麵包機及烘焙器具。\n4.  **食品調理家電 (Food Preparation Appliances)：** 包含果汁機、食物調理機、冰淇淋機、榨汁機，以及製冰飲機與涼風扇。\n5.  **美妝家電與空氣淨化 (Beauty Appliances & Air Purification)：** 提供美髮及護膚家電，以及空氣清淨機與風扇等居家環境產品。\n\nSharkNinja 透過傳統零售通路、電子商務平台、經銷商以及自有品牌 (Shark 和 Ninja) 的直銷模式，將產品推向市場。公司以其創新的產品設計和技術整合能力，滿足消費者在居家生活、烹飪、清潔及個人護理等方面的多樣化需求。","address":"89 A Street","city":"Needham","state":"MA","zip":"02494","country":"US","phone":"617-243-0235","full_address":"89 A Street, Needham, MA 02494, US","range_52w":"83.12-200.39","year_high":200.39,"year_low":83.12,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":83.12,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":20000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":20000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":9670,"price":184.98,"total_val":1.79},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Barrocas Mark","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":100000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Barrocas Mark","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":39350,"price":184.98,"total_val":7.28},{"date":"2026-10-09","name":"Barrocas Mark","title":"director, officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":100000,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":10941,"price":185.27,"total_val":2.03},{"date":"2026-08-28","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":39059,"price":186.66,"total_val":7.29},{"date":"2026-08-21","name":"Feld Peter","title":"director","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":5000,"price":180,"total_val":0.9},{"date":"2026-08-11","name":"Shah Neil B.","title":"officer: Chief Commercial Officer","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":18721